#: .\templates\about.html:23
msgid ""
"Fashion Store is a modern online clothing store that offers a wide range of "
"quality and stylish clothing for the whole family. We have been in the "
"market for over 10 years and during this time we have gained the trust of "
"thousands of customers throughout Uzbekistan."
msgstr ""
"Fashion Store - bu butun oila uchun keng assortimentdagi sifatli va "
"zamonaviy kiyimlarni taklif qiladigan zamonaviy onlayn kiyim do'koni. Biz "
"bozorda 10 yildan ortiq vaqt davomida ishlaymiz va bu vaqt ichida "
"O'zbekiston bo'ylab minglab mijozlarning ishonchini qozondik."

#: .\templates\about.html:31
msgid "Our Mission"
msgstr "Bizning missiyamiz"

#: .\templates\about.html:32
msgid ""
"We strive to make quality and fashionable clothing accessible to everyone. "
"Our goal is to help you look stylish and feel confident by offering the best"
" products at fair prices."
msgstr ""
"Biz sifatli va zamonaviy kiyimlarni hamma uchun qulay qilishga intilamiz. "
"Bizning maqsadimiz - adolatli narxlarda eng yaxshi mahsulotlarni taklif "
"qilib, sizga zamonaviy ko'rinish va o'ziga ishonch his qilishda yordam "
"berish."

#: .\templates\about.html:35
msgid "Our Vision"
msgstr "Bizning ko'rinishimiz"

#: .\templates\about.html:36
msgid ""
"Fashion Store was founded in 2014 with a simple idea - to make quality "
"clothing accessible to everyone. Starting with a small store, we have grown "
"into a large online store serving customers throughout the country."
msgstr ""
"Fashion Store 2014 yilda oddiy g'oya bilan tashkil etilgan - sifatli "
"kiyimlarni hamma uchun qulay qilish. Kichik do'kondan boshlab, biz mamlakat "
"bo'ylab mijozlarga xizmat ko'rsatadigan katta onlayn do'konga aylandik."

